<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged down to 1.8620 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged down to 1.8620 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.8620 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.8500 at the previous session.</p>
<p>							     April 2</p>
<p>April 1</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8620	     1.8500</p>
<p> Volume traded			$14.50 million	 $6.94 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 244 9150</p>
